message: >-
  If you use this benchmark framework or its published results, please cite it.
title: Open Local AI Hardware Benchmark & Compatibility Initiative
type: software
authors:
  - name: Open Local AI Hardware Benchmark contributors
repository-code: "https://github.com/webdevsamran/local-ai-hardware-bench"
url: "https://github.com/webdevsamran/local-ai-hardware-bench"
abstract: >-
  A vendor-neutral, reproducible framework for evaluating local AI runtimes
  across CPUs, GPUs, NPUs, AI PCs, workstations, mini PCs, and edge
  accelerators. Results include full environment capture and are validated
  against a versioned schema.
keywords:
